From 33cd8b5657666326a9e64b5bc06c8b02a2b4f357 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ahmetv10 <ahmetv10@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 19:03:29 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ui): polish ribbon, viewport empty state and ground grid

- Ribbon group headers removed; cells name themselves; labels truncate in-cell.
- Ribbon cells enlarged (72x40, 24px glyph); font tokens bumped.
- Tab titles capitalised; dev status text removed.
- Empty viewport shows a one-line hint.
- Z=0 ground grid (1-2-5 steps, zoom-aware, fades at rim, depth-tested).

Fixes #766
